--- kps-S31ap honest refinement (Chen-Cusick 23) ---
The near-tight configs ({1..12,182} M=0.0765 denom 183; {1..11,13,84} M=0.0786 denom 89) sit JUST ABOVE
1/14, NOT at 2/23. So Chen-Cusick's 1/23=0.0435 is the unconditional FLOOR (well below 1/14), and the hard
part is closing 1/23 -> 1/14. The "23 = project's M=2/23 worst case" link (HYP-3215) is a SPECIFIC
bounded-D coincidence (THM-566), NOT a universal structural identity -- the general hard cases are at 1/14
with various denoms. The Chen-Cusick baseline is real but does not shortcut the 1/23->1/14 closing.
